> Recorded outcomes and limits

The held-out accuracy is 0.5859 (cross-entropy 0.6583), compared with the last-value baseline 0.5625, majority baseline 0.5000 and marked-value oracle 1.0000. Flipping the marked token gives accuracy 0.6250; flipping only the last distractor gives 0.6172. These are fixed source controls, not additional training. The finite synthetic test pool and short budget limit conclusions about generalization.

All three validation epochs are plotted; the test pool does not select the checkpoint.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/clockwork_rnn_history.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){std::filesystem::create_directories("build");std::ifstream input("build/recurrent-models/models/clockwork_rnn/history.tsv");if(!input)throw std::runtime_error("Missing source history");std::string line;std::getline(input,line);std::vector<double> epoch,loss;while(std::getline(input,line)){std::istringstream row(line);double x,y;if(!(row>>x>>y))throw std::runtime_error("Invalid history row");epoch.push_back(x);loss.push_back(y);}if(epoch.size()!=3)throw std::runtime_error("Expected all three source epochs");dm::graphics::RPlot::create().lines(epoch,loss,"Validation objective",{37,99,235}).points(epoch,loss,"All recorded epochs",{234,88,12},5).x_label("Epoch").y_label("Validation cross-entropy").title("Clockwork RNN: validation history").size(950,520).save_svg("build/clockwork_rnn_history.svg");std::cout<<"| Epoch | Validation objective |\n|---:|---:|\n";for(std::size_t i=0;i<epoch.size();++i)std::cout<<"|"<<epoch[i]<<"|"<<loss[i]<<"|\n";}

